    "description": "Six questionable souls. One small ship. Your orders.\n\nYou are the captain of a patched-up sloop on the Quarrelsome Sea. Set a standing directive (make your fortune, hunt raiders, play it safe) and your crew decide how to get there. Every sailor has a role, a temper and habits of their own, and they learn from the orders you give them.\n\n- Chart a course between ports, islands and wrecks, trade spice, resupply and refit your hull.\n- Send two of the crew ashore by longboat for timber, buried treasure or salvage, and manage the ship short-handed while they are gone.\n- Take on contracts, bring rival ships within range and trade broadsides.\n- Keep the chain of command: off-role orders need an officer's warrant and real danger.\n\nPlay local practice straight away, or sign in to create a persistent shared sea and invite other captains to join it with a room code.",
